{{!--
    Platforms: waiting for a train, or changing to another line.

    {{alight}}, {{signs}} and {{train}} come from tube.js. "platform" is the name on the signs, such
    as "northbound Victoria line", and "ways" is a list of the other platforms at this station.
--}}

{{!-- Getting off a train clears the screen. Changing platforms carries on down the page --}}
[[platform]]:
@leave fade 1s
{{#if previous_section != "change"}}{{clear}}{{alight}}{{/if}}
{{signs}}
{{#if platform}}
{{append "platforms" (add platform (add " at " station))}}
I am standing on the platform for the {{platform}} at {{station}}.

{{#if ways.length = 0}}
I will [wait] for a train.
{{else if ways.length = 1}}
I could [wait] for a train here, or [[go the other way]](change, to = ways[0]).
{{else}}
I could [wait] for a train here, or [change] to another line.
{{/if}}
{{else}}
{{!-- The end of the line: there are no more trains this way --}}
I could change to {{embed "ways"}}.
{{/if}}

[wait]:
{{train}}A {{line_name}} line train arrives. The doors open. I can {{#if heather_soon}}[[get on]](Heather){{else}}[[get on]]{{/if}}.{{#if other_trains}} Or I could [wait] for another train.{{/if}}

[change]:
I could change to {{embed "ways"}}.

[[ways]]:
{{#join ways ", " " or "}}the [[{{this}}]](change, to = "{{this}}"){{/join}}

[[change]]:
{{#if station = "Green Park" and (platform contains "Piccadilly") != (to contains "Piccadilly")}}
{{#once}}
Such a rookie error, changing at Green Park. I follow the signs, walking through the interminably long tunnel, past the annoying busker. I wish there was one of those travelator things here.
{{else}}
Through the long tunnel again I go, following the signs.
{{/once}}
{{else}}
I follow the signs.
{{/if}}
{{set "platform" to}}{{goto "platform"}}
